      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a weird way to put it. can you just stick to the math? i don't really get the \"minions\" thing. can you show me an actual example with numbers? like if i owe 10k at 5% interest, how much of my first payment goes to interest vs principal?",
      "source": "evaluator"
